                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s outrageous that five years later, the Department of Health still can\u2019t or won\u2019t answer a basic question about one of the most disastrous policy decisions made during the pandemic. Thousands of New Yorkers lost loved ones in nursing homes, and they deserve transparency, accountability, and honesty from their government, not stonewalling.",
