                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Whether it\u2019s a car accident on the Taconic Parkway, a fire in Rockland County, or a medical emergency in Westchester, our first responders are always there when we need them most. On National First Responder Day, I want to thank the firefighters, police officers, EMTs, and dispatchers across the Hudson Valley who put their lives on the line to protect ours.\n\nYour service embodies the very best of New York.",
