                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week\u2019s passage of the NDAA is a major win. It strengthens our military, defends our allies, and delivers real results for Hudson Valley servicemembers and their families. \n\nWe secured pay raises, better housing, childcare, and improved medical access for our troops, along with investments in cutting-edge technology and strategic deterrence. \n\nI\u2019m proud this year\u2019s NDAA includes four of my bills. The NDAA also reinforces our commitments to key allies like Israel and Taiwan. At the end of the day, this is about keeping our nation safe and delivering for New York\u2019s 17th District.",
