                "retweet_count": 19,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We\u2019re facing two key issues: the COVID-era premium tax credits, set to expire this year, and long-term health care costs, with premiums up 96% since Obamacare. \n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019ve signed onto two discharge petitions. If every Democrat signed on, we could force a vote. Leader Jeffries should let his members sign these petitions.",
