                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019ve signed two discharge petitions to advance a bipartisan framework that extends the enhanced ACA premium tax credits while pairing that relief with real, structural reforms. These approaches include sensible income limits, pharmacy benefit manager reforms, expanded Health Savings Accounts, and insurance changes aimed at driving down costs over the long term.\n\nFamilies in New York and across the country cannot afford more uncertainty or higher costs.",
